@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:进入会客厅后，<br>我观察着陆续进来的少女们。|#0201Adv04_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她们就是【魔女】……？<br>　包括我在内，每个人都是不应该存在的错误？）|#0201Adv04_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（最终都会变成像那个看守一样的怪物？）|#0201Adv04_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（不，我才不是错误的。<br>　错误的是她才对）|#0201Adv04_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@Wait WaitMode:0.4
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:我用余光瞥见艾玛，<br>一个打扮成侦探的少女——橘雪莉正在向她搭话。|#0201Adv04_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:90 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1
@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:看守堵在入口处。<br>看来所有人都已经进入会客厅了。|#0201Adv04_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:包括我在内，少女们共有13名之多。<br>大部分少女都显得慌乱，表情困惑。|#0201Adv04_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:恐怕除了我之外，没人理解现在的情况。<br>于是，我站到了房间中央。|#0201Adv04_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都是初次见面，<br>来做个自我介绍吧！|#0201Adv04_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我用稍大的声音提议，<br>原本嘈杂的少女们都将注意力集中到了我身上。|#0201Adv04_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我是二阶堂希罗。<br>今后请多关照。|#0201Adv04_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号659 二階堂ヒロ』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『正義の執行者』を入れる。
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我微笑着做了自我介绍，<br>立刻走近的是莲见蕾雅。|#0201Adv04_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:你看起来相当冷静啊……<br>难不成，你其实对这个地方很了解？|#0201Adv04_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:不，完全不了解。|#0201Adv04_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅用怀疑的视线看着我。我们四目相对。<br>我毫不为之动摇，只是笑意更浓。|#0201Adv04_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……嗯，好吧。<br>我是莲见蕾雅。请多关照。|#0201Adv04_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号662 蓮見レイア』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『舞台上の偶像《アイドル》』を入れる。
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:喂喂，蕾雅亲。<br>我感觉好像在电视上<br>见过你哦～|#0201Adv04_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她是个艺人。经常上电视，舞台演出也很多。|#0201Adv04_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看到猫耳少女泽渡可可向这边走近，<br>我像要打断她一样迅速说道。|#0201Adv04_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:哈啊？<br>我是在跟那边那个王子风格的人说话，又不是跟你说啦～？|#0201Adv04_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不想在无关紧要的信息上浪费时间。<br>顺带一提，她不会给路人签名，也不接受合作邀约。|#0201Adv04_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:这家伙什么毛病啊……|#0201Adv04_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:赶快开始自我介绍行不行？|#0201Adv04_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:我用威压的语气说道。<br>可可露出了惊恐的眼神。|#0201Adv04_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我叫泽渡可可。|#0201Adv04_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号669 沢渡ココ』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『孤独な配信者《ソロ・ストリーマー》』を入れる。
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你的介绍。|#0201Adv04_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Coco Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:感受到场面的主导权几乎已经掌握在我手中，<br>我环视其他还在困惑的少女们。|#0201Adv04_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还没有自我介绍的，快点！|#0201Adv04_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR16
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:我来我来～！我叫橘雪莉。<br>哪里有案件哪里就有我！<br>一切就交给我这位名侦探吧！|#0201Adv04_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号667 橘シェリー』の立ち絵とキャッチコピー
; 『破壊探偵《クラッシャー》』を入れる。
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:哦。下一个！|#0201Adv04_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL11

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～，不跟我开开玩笑吗？|#0201Adv04_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对你没兴趣。<br>还有谁没自我介绍？|#0201Adv04_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:你这个人怎么回事，怎么能那么自以为是！？<br>你以为你是谁——|#0201Adv04_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:能不能闭嘴。<br>啊，不过自我介绍还是要的。|#0201Adv04_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果不继续维持互相介绍名字的流程，<br>我和你们之间可能会产生认知偏差。|#0201Adv04_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:产生不正确的扭曲是不好的。|#0201Adv04_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你还是老样子，一点都没变啊……|#0201Adv04_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你和希罗是认识的吗？<br>看起来，除了你们俩，<br>其他人似乎没有像你们俩这样本来就认识的。|#0201Adv04_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，嗯，是的。我叫樱羽艾玛。|#0201Adv04_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号658 桜羽エマ』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『忌み嫌われるもの』を入れる。
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我和希罗是从小一起长大的……<br>虽然初中分到了别的班。|#0201Adv04_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗以前<br>就一直担任班长或者学生会主席。|#0201Adv04_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:哦！她确实看起来有这种感觉。<br>把场面交给她来主持<br>似乎更好。|#0201Adv04_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:冒昧打扰，<br>能请教你的名字吗？|#0201Adv04_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:……呵，我是远野汉娜。<br>往后请多多指照……往后请多多关教？|#0201Adv04_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号668 遠野ハンナ』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『空想令嬢』を入れる。
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:被蕾雅这么温柔搭话，汉娜红着脸，<br>扭过头说道。|#0201Adv04_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:下一个！|#0201Adv04_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:一位散发妖冶气息的少女走上前来。|#0201Adv04_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀哎呀，怎么催得这么急呢？<br>我叫宝生玛格哦。|#0201Adv04_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号664 宝生マーゴ』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『愛を知る人』を入れる。
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:看来这里有种不允许闲聊的氛围？真遗憾。|#0201Adv04_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:互相知道名字就行了。|#0201Adv04_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:马上就会有人来对这个监牢的事作说明，<br>我不想浪费时间。|#0201Adv04_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:——为什么。|#0201Adv04_Nanoka001| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你，为什么会知道这些……？|#0201Adv04_Nanoka002| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:一个眼神阴郁的少女，黑部奈叶香<br>略显惊讶地睁大了眼睛。|#0201Adv04_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我是黑部奈叶香。你是什么人……？|#0201Adv04_Nanoka003| AuthorId:Nanoka RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号665 黒部ナノカ』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『過去からの狙撃手《スナイパー》』を入れる。
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才已经报过名字了。我什么人也不是。<br>好了，下一个，那边那个你！|#0201Adv04_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:呀！<br>我、我叫冰上梅露露……|#0201Adv04_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号670 氷上メルル』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『怯える天使』を入れる。
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:下一个！|#0201Adv04_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:好可怕！大、大叔我的心快要崩溃了……|#0201Adv04_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:大叔？算了，可以报上名来吗。|#0201Adv04_Hiro022| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:佐伯米莉亚……|#0201Adv04_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号663 佐伯ミリア』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『高校デビューギャル』を入れる。
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,25 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Normal1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:角落里蜷缩着的少女，<br>正在往素描本上写着什么。|#0201Adv04_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（搞这么麻烦……<br>　磨磨蹭蹭的……）|#0201Adv04_Hiro023|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:她是夏目安安。|#0201Adv04_Hiro024| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70,50 IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Surprised1,Angle01/Option_Arms-

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0201Adv04_AnAn001| AuthorId:AnAn RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号660 夏目アンアン』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『虚言《ソラゴト》の眠り姫』を入れる。
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:因为我抢先说出了她的名字，<br>安安显得很震惊。|#0201Adv04_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:还有几个少女没有自我介绍。|#0201Adv04_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:眼神叛逆的少女，紫藤亚里沙。<br>自由随性的少女，城崎诺亚。|#0201Adv04_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那边那个，你还没自我介绍吧？|#0201Adv04_Hiro025| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙向我投来锐利的目光。|#0201Adv04_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:不想介绍。<br>我，讨厌像你这样的人。|#0201Adv04_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:派头跟个班长似的，<br>让人恶心得起鸡皮疙瘩。|#0201Adv04_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:紫藤亚里沙。<br>看来你听说过我曾经当过班长的事。<br>对我很感兴趣？|#0201Adv04_Hiro026| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:什么……！？|#0201Adv04_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号666 紫藤アリサ』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『自罰中毒』を入れる。
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:那边那个随心所欲的，<br>是城崎诺亚。|#0201Adv04_Hiro027| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:15 IdAndAppearance:Noah.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？|#0201Adv04_Noah001| AuthorId:Noah RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; 演出：『囚人番号661 城ケ崎ノア』の立ち絵と、キャッチコピー
; 『偽りの芸術家《アーティスト》』を入れる。
; ========================================

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我一声拍手。|#0201Adv04_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:介绍完毕！|#0201Adv04_Hiro028| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他少女看我的眼神<br>明显变得充满怀疑。|#0201Adv04_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，希罗……<br>你为什么会知道大家叫什么名字……？|#0201Adv04_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:这真是太令人在意了呢～！<br>该我这个名侦探出场了吧！|#0201Adv04_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:……老实说，我意识到自己有些失去了冷静。<br>我悄悄叹了口气。|#0201Adv04_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（也许，我有点操之过急了）|#0201Adv04_Hiro029| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……或许是想避免<br>　对她们产生感情）|#0201Adv04_Hiro030|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR6,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:二阶堂希罗知道大家名字的原因，<br>那就是……没错！超能力！|#0201Adv04_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她肯定是会读心！|#0201Adv04_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:原来是这样吗，希罗！？|#0201Adv04_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:怎么可能啊。这些家伙是傻吗？|#0201Adv04_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅轻咳一声，举起了手。|#0201Adv04_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:我可以说几句吗？<br>各位好像都被人穿上了莫名其妙的衣服吧。|#0201Adv04_Leia006| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位看看自己的衣服口袋。<br>好像每个人都分到了一部手机。|#0201Adv04_Leia007| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这是我不知道的信息。<br>我心里暗暗惊讶，同时把手伸进自己的衣服口袋。|#0201Adv04_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:果然，正如蕾雅所说，<br>里面有一部智能手机。|#0201Adv04_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，口袋里<br>还有另一样东西。|#0201Adv04_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『ヒロの万年筆』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:10-1
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:（这是……！）|#0201Adv04_Hiro031| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的心脏因震惊而狂跳，<br>但还是勉强保持着面无表情。|#0201Adv04_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:真的欸，有了这个，也许就能和外界联系了！|#0201Adv04_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:不，遗憾的是，没有信号，<br>不能用来和外界联络。|#0201Adv04_Leia008| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:这部手机里有一个<br>叫【魔女图鉴】的APP。<br>上面记录了我们所有人的名字。|#0201Adv04_Leia009| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR4,ArmL5

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉拍了下手。|#0201Adv04_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR6,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:所有谜题都解开了！！|#0201Adv04_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵呵，二阶堂希罗……<br>你是通过这个【魔女图鉴】……|#0201Adv04_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:不用说到最后了哇。<br>大家都已经明白了。|#0201Adv04_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边操作着手机，<br>一边偷偷观察蕾雅。|#0201Adv04_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（上一次我太早就结束了监牢生活，<br>　所以不知道的事还是太多了）|#0201Adv04_Hiro032|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（信息越多越好。<br>　目前尽量获取更多信息才是明智之举）|#0201Adv04_Hiro033|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:（……时间差不多了）|#0201Adv04_Hiro034| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我仰望天花板附近。|#0201Adv04_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
