[PrintTextModified Text:啊……好多人……<br>呃，我再重新自我介绍下……<br>我是受命管理这座宅邸的可爱猫头鹰，典狱长……|#0201Adv04_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……因为下班时间快到了……<br>我就抓紧时间开始说明咯……|#0201Adv04_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……非常遗憾地告诉大家……<br>各位的身上拥有成为【魔女】的因子。|#0201Adv04_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

