[PrintTextModified Text:心脏剧烈地跳动着，咚咚作响。<br>眼前的一切开始摇晃，自我意识濒临崩塌。|#0201Adv04_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我只想否定一切，<br>只想不顾一切发狂挣扎。|#0201Adv04_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这种情绪到底是什么……为什么……）|#0201Adv04_Hiro036| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我——|#0201Adv04_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

