# Choice2-1-1

@RecordCorrectChoice Number:16

[PrintTextModified Text:（要忍耐……！）|#0201Adv04_Hiro037| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我下意识地狠狠咬紧牙关，血腥味在口中弥漫开来。|#0201Adv04_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_10_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:从这个春季开始，<br>请大家以囚犯的身份，在这里生活下去。|#0201Adv04_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:得救的方法倒也不是没有……<br>只要能找到【大魔女】，就能将各位的诅咒……|#0201Adv04_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，不过，让你们抱有期待也不太好……<br>请把这事忘了吧。|#0201Adv04_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（大魔女……？）|#0201Adv04_Hiro038| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然很在意大魔女和救赎这些词，<br>但我还是克制住了自己，没有开口。|#0201Adv04_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:接着，典狱长开始介绍看守——<br>魔女的【残骸】。|#0201Adv04_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，顺带一提，看守就是过去收监在此的人<br>成为了魔女后的样子。|#0201Adv04_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们称之为【残骸】。|#0201Adv04_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:多数成为魔女的人都会被处刑，<br>但我们会挑出其中比较容易使唤的，对它进行心灵操控。|#0201Adv04_Warden009| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们已经命令它们，只要谁敢反抗就杀谁……<br>真是不好意思，反抗的话就请你去死吧。|#0201Adv04_Warden010| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

