[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0201Adv04_Hiro039| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:我用阴郁的眼神<br>望向看守。|#0201Adv04_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要不出声，不反抗，<br>看守就不会向我挥下镰刀。|#0201Adv04_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:上次被杀死的冲击和精神痛苦再次袭上心头。<br>这一切都鲜明地烙印在记忆中。|#0201Adv04_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（……不，我要忘记。我已经成功避免了死亡）|#0201Adv04_Hiro040| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我不能再失控了）|#0201Adv04_Hiro041| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

; ＠備考◆コソッと

[PrintTextModified Text:那个，希罗。<br>你的脸色很差，你还好吗……？|#0201Adv04_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

