[PrintTextModified Text:旁边的艾玛向我搭话，<br>使我更加心悸。|#0201Adv04_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别管我。|#0201Adv04_Hiro042| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我不留情面地说道。<br>于是艾玛一脸失落地离开。|#0201Adv04_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和艾玛拉开距离以后，<br>我稍微轻松了一些。|#0201Adv04_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（果然，我只要感知到艾玛的存在，<br>　就会变得无法抑制感情）|#0201Adv04_Hiro043|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（但我应该不是这么冲动的性格才对）|#0201Adv04_Hiro044| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我身上到底发生了什么……？）|#0201Adv04_Hiro045| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:——啊，还有几句话要说，真是不好意思。<br>有一件最重要的事情，<br>要跟大家说清楚。|#0201Adv04_Warden011| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即将转变为魔女的人，<br>会产生无法抑制的杀意或妄想。|#0201Adv04_Warden012| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我猛地抬起头看着典狱长。|#0201Adv04_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这就会带来一桩麻烦事……<br>总有一天囚犯内部会发生凶杀案。|#0201Adv04_Warden013| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL8

[PrintTextModified Text:凶杀案！？|#0201Adv04_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊……每次都会有这种事……<br>再怎么说也不可能和这么危险的人共同生活，对不对。|#0201Adv04_Warden014| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以呢，只要发生了凶杀案，<br>我们就会举行【魔女审判】。|#0201Adv04_Warden015| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:成为【魔女】的囚犯呢……嗯……<br>……就会处以死刑……|#0201Adv04_Warden016| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:3

[PrintTextModified Text:详细情况麻烦去看【魔女图鉴】。<br>我就失陪啦……|#0201Adv04_Warden017| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:说完，典狱长拍打着翅膀飞进通风口，<br>消失不见了。|#0201Adv04_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_26_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我马上拿出手机，<br>打开魔女图鉴APP。|#0201Adv04_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『囚犯受到强烈精神压力后，<br>　魔女因子会得到增强，魔女化程度便会加深』|#0201Adv04_Narrative049|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『成为魔女之人，有可能会因为难以忍受的<br>　杀人冲动，犯下杀人的罪行』|#0201Adv04_Narrative050|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:阅读完魔女图鉴里的内容，我理解了。|#0201Adv04_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（魔女化导致的杀人冲动……）|#0201Adv04_Hiro046| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

