[PrintTextModified Text:一阵寒意直冲脊背，我猛地摇了摇头。|#0201Adv04_Narrative053| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（冷静点……保持清醒……！）|#0201Adv04_Hiro050| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经理解了自己失控的原因，<br>也接受了这个事实。|#0201Adv04_Narrative054| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但我通过克服上次的死亡，<br>已经能够成功压制住黑暗的感情了。|#0201Adv04_Narrative055| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（已经没事了。我能保持自我）|#0201Adv04_Hiro051| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我绝不会堕为魔女）|#0201Adv04_Hiro052| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我要作为给世界带来秩序的正确之人，<br>　制裁魔女——！）|#0201Adv04_Hiro053|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我深深吸了口气，<br>目光坚定地投向前方。|#0201Adv04_Narrative056| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:却仍有无法言喻的某种感觉，<br>正缓慢而无声地渗入我的胸口。|#0201Adv04_Narrative057| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 魔女図鑑初期更新
@GosubResetWitchBook Path:System/System_ResetWitchBook
@SetCustomVariable Expression:"hasWitchBook = true"

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

@BeginIf Expression:!enableDebugSkip
    @ProcessInput InputEnabled:true SetEnabled:"Continue.false,Pause.false,Skip.false,ToggleSkip.false,AutoPlay.false,ToggleUI.false,ShowBacklog.false,Rollback.false,SkipMovie.{g_moviePlayed >= 2}"
    @PlayMovie MovieName:Act02_Opening Wait:true

@SetCustomVariable Expression:"g_moviePlayed = max(2, g_moviePlayed)"
@GotoModified Path:Act02_Chapter01/Act02_Chapter01_Adv05 SoftReset:true

